WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.719
The lion.

00:02.419 --> 00:11.221
A backwards question mark for the mane and a triangle for the hindquarters: the lion is one of the few figures that looks like its name.

00:11.671 --> 00:15.385
The bright star at its chest is Regulus, the little king.

00:15.835 --> 00:19.184
The Sun passes right beside it every August.
